		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  grant]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=8143#p8143"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>en m&#039;excusant&#160; voila </p><br /><p>-- role de groupe<br />CREATE ROLE niv1_eco NOSUPERUSER NOINHERIT NOCREATEDB NOCREATEROLE;<br />&#160; <br />-- role de connection <br />CREATE ROLE user33&#160; WITH LOGIN PASSWORD &#039;1234&#039;;<br />GRANT niv1_eco to user33;<br />ALTER ROLE user33 SET ROLE= &#039;niv1_eco&#039;&#160; ;&#160; <br />CREATE SCHEMA&#160; w_user33&#160; &#160; ;&#160; &#160; <br />ALTER SCHEMA&#160; &#160;w_user33&#160; OWNER TO user33;<br />GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES&#160; &#160;ON SCHEMA&#160; w_user33&#160; TO&#160; user33&#160; WITH GRANT OPTION;</p>]]></content>
