	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  grant]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=8140#p8140"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>voici mon script integral</p><p>-- creation role groupe<br />CREATE ROLE niv1_eco<br />&#160; NOSUPERUSER NOINHERIT NOCREATEDB NOCREATEROLE;</p><p>-- -- creation role de connection <br /> CREATE ROLE user1&#160; WITH LOGIN PASSWORD &#039; 1234&#039;<br /> GRANT niv1_eco to user1<br />&#160; ALTER ROLE user1 SET ROLE= &#039; niv1_eco&#039;&#160; &#160; <br /> CREATE SCHEMA&#160; w_user1&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; <br />&#160; ALTER SCHEMA&#160; &#160;w_user1&#160; OWNER TO user1<br /> GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES&#160; &#160;ON SCHEMA&#160; w_user1&#160; TO&#160; user1&#160; WITH GRANT OPTION</p><p>quand je fais la connection postgres avec user1 et mot de passe 1234 <br />et que je vais dans w_user1 je ne peux pas creer une table <br />merci</p>]]></content>
